:''This article is about the Cat Unit. For the enemy, see [[Mentori (Enemy)]].''
'''Mentori''' is a [[:Category:Rare Cats|Rare Cat]] added in [[Version 6.9 Update|Version 6.9]] that can be acquired as a treasure drop when playing any stage of [[Mentori Collaboration Event#Mentori's Masterplan|Mentori's Masterplan]] during the [[Mentori Collaboration Event]].

{{Cat Info
|ID = 399
|rarity = RR
|name1 = Mentori
|name2 = Mentori CC
}}

==Evolution==
Evolves into '''Mentori CC''' at level 10.

==Strategy/Usage==
There are many better options for tanking or protecting your other cats from Floating enemies such as [[Kotatsu Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Kotatsu Cat]]. Mentori may still find some use on 4-crown stages as an anti-Floating meatshield, but even then though it's still a waste of a slot.

{{Job|Classification = Meatshield}}

